{
 "batchId": "b-0463",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_bb26565fe5ebd9c25fb3",
   "sourceHash": "bb26565fe5ebd9c25fb3d3dd4d8fe4632ce4e8b683cb49c2fb7180300dea704f",
   "text": "金色沙滩与碧绿海水交相辉映的纯净海滩。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b363dd02e0dc87e2b2b3",
   "sourceHash": "b363dd02e0dc87e2b2b375fb43eaca72953cd03b58c5d793e1590a044b6b062d",
   "text": "蒙纳（Munnar）和瓦亚纳德（Wayanad）等苍翠山城，景色令人叹为观止。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f64c648e799e78fdc9c7",
   "sourceHash": "f64c648e799e78fdc9c7e0b3e9a50c367561d4517d96b0daa14bedf9315d88a8",
   "text": "宁静的回水区，船屋在平静的水面上悠然滑行。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ba9dde625947d0820bde",
   "sourceHash": "ba9dde625947d0820bdea10c7833e820a5f702c70b437e271c87c47b3f26078e",
   "text": "茂密的森林和野生动物保护区，遍布奇花异草与珍禽异兽。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7070dc47f8c547de7bf9",
   "sourceHash": "7070dc47f8c547de7bf9f0ee7e27ec351c39a7e786662b38b32eabf8155afdb1",
   "text": "文化遗产",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2a84b4fa390f72a44ffa",
   "sourceHash": "2a84b4fa390f72a44ffabf8165c57d918f5afd5545f2723dbddfe0d98cfeddb2",
   "text": "文化遗产：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6e09de1549fb47e958da",
   "sourceHash": "6e09de1549fb47e958daeccf409d911c3fb58ddc67f8b4b6002f80eac170885a",
   "text": "探索卡塔卡利（Kathakali）、莫希尼亚坦（Mohiniyattam）和泰扬（Theyyam）等古老艺术形式。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c25cfcb9f494be058921",
   "sourceHash": "c25cfcb9f494be05892115af23a25a32753b51a367c48173106bd1903ac64b6e",
   "text": "探访历史悠久的寺庙、教堂和宫殿，领略喀拉拉丰富多元的文化底蕴。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_712248bb475b185839fb",
   "sourceHash": "712248bb475b185839fbd3da33ed5364caab10473ea4dfb52e788303f0bde77d",
   "text": "参与欧南节（Onam）、维舒节（Vishu）和特里苏尔普拉姆节（Thrissur Pooram）等热闹节庆。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bbf47fac6172af494ac9",
   "sourceHash": "bbf47fac6172af494ac9ac351a36756d3203107541902481651b28dfbe78d8ef",
   "text": "美食之乐：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d2d6af23ed057c88d1ff",
   "sourceHash": "d2d6af23ed057c88d1ffe5dc852ed55bd76721a6d3a0d5547adfdfb351406a9f",
   "text": "品尝传统喀拉拉美食，香料、新鲜椰子与芳香草本和谐交融。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_63e05b98b20f64c19af5",
   "sourceHash": "63e05b98b20f64c19af5ff9ceb4f3c20a64a8c2065e7edcb159b441e859d0dd5",
   "text": "享用阿帕姆配炖菜（appam with stew）、喀拉拉宴席（sadya）以及新鲜捕捞的海鲜等佳肴。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_493140ec1e12270683e8",
   "sourceHash": "493140ec1e12270683e8ed35e8b5f23a3a5901015b69c1786a1162dcecf36c8c",
   "text": "阿育吠陀与健康",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_85b3760d598986f6ff84",
   "sourceHash": "85b3760d598986f6ff84a43e69fc1b4ad79f0bc251acbd9ab72f2d84260c55aa",
   "text": "阿育吠陀与健康：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f4834149533ec326a37c",
   "sourceHash": "f4834149533ec326a37c20b9f8fb681487579e0a630157542c8e6751fbbdfaa2",
   "text": "喀拉拉是阿育吠陀的发源地，提供正宗的治疗与疗法。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cfe58d0716c3b4b8da50",
   "sourceHash": "cfe58d0716c3b4b8da50e6c4a92d0843a0b2d206b154542f299906aadf31479d",
   "text": "通过阿育吠陀按摩、排毒项目和 Panchakarma（潘查卡玛）治疗，焕新身心。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c8d6b2795d35c04f4029",
   "sourceHash": "c8d6b2795d35c04f402992252b0d087a13af81f414a878d3203fb94e8f8ca5a2",
   "text": "Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村：通往健康之门",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Brand rendered using the approved term 阿育吠陀疗愈村 for 'The Ayurvedic Healing Village'."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_651249997fda8d307de6",
   "sourceHash": "651249997fda8d307de6f535fc63b7ba55bd7eb95557b1dd1d40c11270d1654f",
   "text": "Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村坐落于帕拉卡德（Palakkad）宁静的自然风光之中，将传统阿育吠陀疗法与现代健康设施独特融合。在这里，您可以沉浸于阿育吠陀的整体疗法，同时探索喀拉拉之美。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Brand rendered using the approved term 阿育吠陀疗愈村; 'the perfect place' softened to a descriptive statement."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b39d13e0e100db42652f",
   "sourceHash": "b39d13e0e100db42652f478a0c7fdbc7799a4310cd410792ff12c97fb2fcd1dc",
   "text": "我们提供：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f694067f2f28bc7c2c19",
   "sourceHash": "f694067f2f28bc7c2c1912b3987d3d730de03d214253d48e6c188be509a4be24",
   "text": "正宗阿育吠陀疗法",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3c66615adf5446fd8e06",
   "sourceHash": "3c66615adf5446fd8e06f73296c16edcb793b2d38faa45bdef2cef4b92ca1f70",
   "text": "：在资深治疗师的指导下，体验 Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）、Shirodhara（希罗达拉）和 Panchakarma（潘查卡玛）等个性化治疗。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7a7866742b8ba6b01be1",
   "sourceHash": "7a7866742b8ba6b01be1c21a0aa4cb0d546926ff52605e39286ae4933bf9c76a",
   "text": "正宗阿育吠陀疗法：在资深治疗师的指导下，体验 Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）、Shirodhara（希罗达拉）和 Panchakarma（潘查卡玛）等个性化治疗。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_063f88718abb9b7abae0",
   "sourceHash": "063f88718abb9b7abae017434505ad9a0c51d37b4d2ee89552f7a4a1f83d4c37",
   "text": "：在经验丰富的导师带领下参加每日课程，与内在的自我连结。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a468cfe722d8c9179c31",
   "sourceHash": "a468cfe722d8c9179c3172e33e97cf5a12913577328b381c0a6f2afb8fee5099",
   "text": "瑜伽与冥想：在经验丰富的导师带领下参加每日课程，与内在的自我连结。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5d569611d9b29ee60453",
   "sourceHash": "5d569611d9b29ee60453ca1249aa0986e4716df7040f854df20d64cd3853b41e",
   "text": "整体健康项目",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
